  "rationale": "The plant automata model the robot's perception (obstacle sensors) and motion subsystem. The specifications bind sensor outcomes to safe, progress-oriented actions, enforce conservative recovery, and ensure that full_rotate and move_backward are used only as last-resort or brief escape actions. The design maximizes coverage by returning to forward exploration as soon as the path is clear, while reliably avoiding collisions.",
